\section{Ordered Einstein-index formulas}
Each repeated index labels exactly one graph edge; its upper and lower
occurrences supply one inverse metric. The machine-readable companion
\texttt{results/rank81\_basis.json} gives the edge lists, adjacency matrices,
formula hashes, and contraction costs.
